{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36255","headline":"赠美人四首 四 · 方干","name":"赠美人四首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔日仙人今玉人，深冬相见亦如春。\n倍酬金价微含笑，才发歌声早动尘。\n昔岁曾爲萧史伴，今朝应作宋家邻。\n百年别後知谁在，须遣丹青画取真。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36255.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36255","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}